  button.addEventListener('click', handler);
}
```

2. **Wait for DOM to load:**
```javascript
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  const button = document.querySelector('.my-button');
  button.addEventListener('click', handler);
});
```

3. **Put script at end of body:**
```html
